# Baseline hardening for Static Assets responses (/store, legal pages, /asset
# files served from public/). Worker-generated responses, including "/" and
# every proxied /api call, get the same two headers from secure() in
# src/index.js, because Cloudflare does not apply this file to them.
# HSTS, frame-ancestors and CSP are intentionally absent until decided.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
